{"seq":3,"slug":"overscan-buffer","title":"过扫描缓冲区：用一点冗余买不露白","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtual-scrolling/techniques/overscan-buffer","wordCount":1435,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"过扫描缓冲区-用一点冗余买不露白\">过扫描缓冲区：用一点冗余买不露白</h1><p>严格按可视区渲染有个致命破绽：滚动是有速度的，而渲染要经过窗口计算、DOM 更新、布局、绘制才能上屏，这中间有延迟。当用户快速滚动，视口已经移到了新位置，新位置的项还没渲染出来，屏幕上就露出一块空白——俗称「白屏」或「闪白」。过扫描（overscan）是对这个破绽的直接补救：在可视区上下各多渲染几项作为缓冲，让即将进入视口的内容提前就位，滚动时永远有内容顶上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>overscan 是刻意打破 <a href=\"../windowing/viewport-window\">可视区与窗口计算</a> 里「区间恰好覆盖可视区」这条不变量——故意多渲染。设可视区需要项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>start</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>end</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\text{start}, \\text{end}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">start</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">end</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，overscan 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，则实际渲染 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>start</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> end</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\text{start}-b,\\ \\text{end}+b]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">start</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">end</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。多出的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 个项是缓冲。它的本质是一个经典权衡：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，快速滚动越不容易露白，但每帧渲染的节点越多、内存和渲染成本越高；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 越小越省，但抗不住快速滚动。目标是找到「刚好覆盖一帧滚动位移 + 渲染延迟」的最小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[可视区 start..end] --&gt; B[实际渲染 start-b .. end+b]&#10;  B --&gt; C{overscan b 多大?}&#10;  C --&gt;|太小| D[快速滚动露白闪屏]&#10;  C --&gt;|太大| E[每帧渲染过多&lt;br/&gt;内存/CPU 浪费]&#10;  C --&gt;|方向感知| F[滚动方向多缓冲&lt;br/&gt;反方向少缓冲]&#10;  F --&gt; G[白屏与成本平衡]&#10;  D --&gt; H[体验差]&#10;  E --&gt; I[性能差]&#10;  G --&gt; J[顺滑且经济]\">flowchart TD\n  A[可视区 start..end] --&gt; B[实际渲染 start-b .. end+b]\n  B --&gt; C{overscan b 多大?}\n  C --&gt;|太小| D[快速滚动露白闪屏]\n  C --&gt;|太大| E[每帧渲染过多&lt;br/&gt;内存/CPU 浪费]\n  C --&gt;|方向感知| F[滚动方向多缓冲&lt;br/&gt;反方向少缓冲]\n  F --&gt; G[白屏与成本平衡]\n  D --&gt; H[体验差]\n  E --&gt; I[性能差]\n  G --&gt; J[顺滑且经济]</pre><p>不同 overscan 取值的效果谱系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>overscan</th>\n<th>露白风险</th>\n<th>渲染成本</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>高（慢滚都可能露）</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>几乎不用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1–3</td>\n<td>低速滚动安全</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>定高、轻量项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5–10</td>\n<td>中高速滚动安全</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>常规不定高列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方向感知动态</td>\n<td>各速度均衡</td>\n<td>自适应</td>\n<td>追求极致的实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过大（如 50+）</td>\n<td>几乎不露</td>\n<td>高，接近失去虚拟化意义</td>\n<td>反模式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"缓冲量该给多少\">缓冲量该给多少</h2><p>一个有物理意义的估算：单帧内滚动位移约等于「滚动速度 × 帧时长（约 16.7ms）」，缓冲高度至少要覆盖「一到两帧的滚动位移 + 渲染管线的延迟位移」。换算成项数，就是这段高度除以平均项高。对定高、内容轻的列表，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 取 2–3 通常够；对不定高、项较重（含图片、复杂布局）的列表，渲染更慢，需要 5–10 甚至更多。但要警惕过度加码：把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 加到几十，等于每帧渲染上百个节点，虚拟化省下的成本又被吐了回去，极端情况下还不如不虚拟化。正确心态是「够用即止」——先给个保守值，再用真机在最快滚动下观察是否露白，逐步收紧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"方向感知-把缓冲花在刀刃上\">方向感知：把缓冲花在刀刃上</h2><p>对称地上下各留 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 其实有浪费——用户向下滚时，缓冲主要该留在下方（前进方向），上方刚滚过的内容短期不会再进视口。方向感知的 overscan 据此优化：检测滚动方向，往前进方向多留缓冲、往反方向少留。这样同样的渲染预算，抗白屏能力更强。实现上只需在窗口计算时根据 <code>scrollTop</code> 与上一次的差判断方向，动态调整 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>start</mtext><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> end</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\text{start}-b_{up},\\ \\text{end}+b_{down}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">start</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">end</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 的两个边界。更进一步可以做速度感知——滚得越快缓冲越大。这些是锦上添花的优化，成熟库通常提供一个 <code>overscan</code> 参数让你手调（见 <a href=\"../practice/virtual-libraries\">库 (TanStack Virtual)</a>），方向/速度自适应则未必内置，需要时自己在其上包一层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"overscan-的隐藏价值-不止防白屏\">overscan 的隐藏价值：不止防白屏</h2><p>缓冲区还顺带解决两个问题。其一是<strong>测量提前</strong>：不定高列表里，缓冲区内的项会被提前渲染和测量，等它们真正进入视口时高度已是实测值，减少了「进视口才测量、测完再锚定」引起的跳动（与 <a href=\"scroll-anchoring\">滚动锚定与跳动</a> 协同）。其二是<strong>焦点与搜索的连续性</strong>：键盘 Tab 导航或页面搜索可能落到刚好在视口边缘外一点的项，有缓冲区它们就在 DOM 里、可被聚焦到，边界体验更平滑（与 <a href=\"../practice/virtual-accessibility\">无障碍与可搜索</a> 相关）。这也是为什么即使定高不会跳动，也仍要给一点 overscan——它的收益不只是防白屏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与滚动节流的联动\">与滚动节流的联动</h2><p>overscan 和滚动事件的处理频率是一对可以互相补偿的旋钮。如果你为了省 CPU 把窗口重算节流得很狠（比如几帧才算一次），那么两次重算之间视口可能已经滑出去不少，就更依赖大 overscan 来兜住这段位移；反过来，如果窗口重算紧跟每一帧（用 <code>requestAnimationFrame</code> 对齐，见 <a href=\"../windowing/viewport-window\">可视区与窗口计算</a>），overscan 就可以给得更小。极端快速的「甩」滚动（拖着滚动条猛拉）是 overscan 也兜不住的——位移远大于任何合理缓冲，此时会短暂露白，正确做法不是把 overscan 加到离谱，而是接受这一帧的白、下一帧立刻补齐，或对甩动中的中间态渲染一个轻量占位骨架而非完整项。把 overscan 当成「稳态滚动的保险」，而不是「任何速度都不露白的承诺」，才是正确的心态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>overscan 在可视区上下多渲染 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 项，用冗余覆盖「滚动速度 × 渲染延迟」造成的白屏。</li>\n<li>它是渲染成本与抗白屏能力的权衡：目标是覆盖一两帧位移的最小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，过大等于放弃虚拟化收益。</li>\n<li>定高轻量项 2–3 项够，不定高重项需 5–10，具体值用真机最快滚动实测收紧。</li>\n<li>方向/速度感知的动态 overscan 把缓冲花在前进方向，同预算抗白屏更强。</li>\n<li>缓冲区还顺带提前测量（减跳动）、改善焦点与搜索的边界连续性，是定高也该留一点的理由。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>兄弟篇：<a href=\"../windowing/viewport-window\">可视区与窗口计算</a> — overscan 正是对其「区间恰好覆盖」的松弛。</li>\n<li>兄弟篇：<a href=\"scroll-anchoring\">滚动锚定与跳动</a> — 缓冲提前测量如何减轻跳动。</li>\n<li>兄弟篇：<a href=\"../practice/virtual-accessibility\">无障碍与可搜索</a> — 缓冲对焦点/搜索边界的帮助。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../frontend-virtualization-windowing/foundations/viewport-overscan\">视口与 overscan</a> — 另一视角的缓冲区讨论。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"过扫描缓冲区：用一点冗余买不露白","id":"过扫描缓冲区-用一点冗余买不露白"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"缓冲量该给多少","id":"缓冲量该给多少"},{"level":2,"text":"方向感知：把缓冲花在刀刃上","id":"方向感知-把缓冲花在刀刃上"},{"level":2,"text":"overscan 的隐藏价值：不止防白屏","id":"overscan-的隐藏价值-不止防白屏"},{"level":2,"text":"与滚动节流的联动","id":"与滚动节流的联动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"滚动锚定与跳动：让视口里的内容纹丝不动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtual-scrolling/techniques/scroll-anchoring"},"next":{"title":"库 (TanStack Virtual)：把前三章封进一个 Hook","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtual-scrolling/practice/virtual-libraries"}}